WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.167
In another world,

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.878
Gaby would be in an oddies band.

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:07.716
Gaby's band name would be something
that's like more like a phrase

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:09.009
like Panic! At The Disco.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.177
Like “For Real?!” with a question mark.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:16.182
Gaby's oddies esthetic was definitely
like razored hair pressed straight,

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.101
like the ponytail’s
just a little too straight

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:19.894
because it hasn't been pressed
that much.

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:23.940
Really colorful pants like hair on pants,
probably something ridiculous like that.

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:27.569
In another world,
Liz started playing pickleball

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:30.655
with Jimmy, but then she becomes the best
pickleball player in the world.

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:33.658
She's playing for New York, playing
pickleball where they have the

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:35.285
U.S. Open in Queens.

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.870
The team is called the Crunchers.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.288
We're going to go green and pink.

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:40.582
So we take the palm tree
esthetic from L.A.,

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:43.543
but we're still in the East Coast,
but we still remember where we're from.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:47.297
In another world, I'm thinking Sean
will be probably a superhero.

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:49.883
He'd have something intelligent
like mind control.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.719
Like if I tell you in your mind
what to do,

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:53.636
how are you going to fight me?

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:54.929
You don’t want to fight that guy.

00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:58.308
Just Diesel in a suit?
Not on your best day.

00:00:58.308 --> 00:00:59.851
Alice needs to let go a little bit.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:03.897
I feel like if she was a lead singer of
like, a punk band in Seattle

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:04.773
in like, the nineties,

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:07.859
I feel like she could really let all her
anger and all her pain go.

00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:09.569
As an homage to Phoebe Bridgers,

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:12.530
the song that Alex listens to,
“I Know the End”

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:14.157
I think it's a great band name.

00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:18.745
I think that Derek would like to move to
the Italian Riviera.

00:01:18.828 --> 00:01:21.790
He would get a nice pair of Speedos
and he'd get

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:24.793
maybe a Vespa scooter
with pockets on the side,

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:28.588
and he'd fill it every day
with fresh sausages and flowers.

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:31.216
He would open a small café.

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:32.383
Everyone knows your name,

00:01:32.383 --> 00:01:37.138
and you really can rediscover
yourself through the coffee.

